B.bat=new A.cN("take-buried",B.dR,"Why is my take buried under the song?","A phone records a good deal quieter than a mastered mix. Open the song, press Tools, then Takes, then Levels, and bring The song down until your take sits where you want it.\n\nThe song's level is yours only: it does not change what anybody else hears.",B.cia)
